    <briefdescription>
<para>Default (no-op) implementation that permits every operation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Used when no RBAC configuration is required. Production deployments that need access control should replace this with <ref refid="classthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_in_memory_rbac_metadata_security_provider" kindref="compound">InMemoryRbacMetadataSecurityProvider</ref> or a custom implementation. </para>
